    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2130$7 - 2019 cQ,s ui 01 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'07'01No. 2130/7 - MONDAY JULY 01, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE NEGOMBO MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Negombo Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of ceased to bemember of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Freedom Front, the recognized political party to whichPonnamperumage Fred Dexter the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member if United National Freedom Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Balasuriyage Nanda Sulochana Perera to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasinghe Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the NegomboMunicipal Council, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Balasuriyage Nanda Sulochana Perera was selected as the member of the Negombo Municipal Council.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Negombo Municipal Council.District Election Office,Gampaha,01st July, 2019.\n\n07 - 496\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
