    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2130$9 - 2019 cQ,s ui 01 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'07'01No. 2130/9 - MONDAY JULY 01, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE JA-ELA URBAN COUNCILUNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Ja-Ela Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the Independent Group to which Jayakodi Arachchige Noel Deckster Perera themember belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returnedmember if Independent Group who belongs to such Independent Group and is not disqualified under Section 9 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the aforesaid Independent Group has communicated his decision to nominateDeekirikege Don Nuwan Sirikumara to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the Ja-Ela UrbanCouncil, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Deekirikege Don Nuwan Sirikumara was selected as the member of the Ja-Ela Urban Council.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Ja-Ela Urban CouncilDistrict Election Office,Gampaha,01st July, 2019.\n\n07 - 498\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 304