    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'02PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 02.07.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nThe Allotments of lands depicted in the Advance Tracing No. PU/VNT/2018/56 dated of 29.03.2018 prepared by the Surveyor-General,situated in the Village called Karaitivu in the Grama Niladhari DivisionNo. 635/1 of Aluth Eluwankulama in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Wanathavilluwa of Puttalam District in North WesternProvince and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Aruwakkalukadu \u2013 Extent: About20.8846 HectaresNorth and East: Road; South and West: Road and Lot B.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Aruwakkalukadu \u2013 Extent: About 0.7458 HectareNorth: Lot C, Road and Lot A; East: Lot A; South: Lot A, Road,Lots H and C; West: Lots H, G and C.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2130$12 \u2013 2019 cQ,s 02 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'07'02No. 2130/12 \u2013 TUESDAY, JULY 02, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 30429 \u2013 36 (07/2019)\n\n03. Lot \u2018C\u2019 \u2013 Aruwakkalukadu \u2013 Extent: About21.9638 HectaresNorth: Road and Lot B; East: Lot B; South: Lot G; West: Lots G,F, E, D and Road.\n\n04. Lot \u2018D\u2019 \u2013 Serakkulithottam \u2013 Extent: About 1.3200 HectareNorth: Road; East: Lot C; Sout