    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2130$16 - 2019 cQ,s ui 03 jeks nodod - 2019'07'03No. 2130/16 - WEDNESDAY, JULY 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A PG 4580\u2014 517 (07/2019)\n\nIMPLEMENTATION OF ALL THE POWERS IN THE DISTRIBUTION OF FILMS BY NATIONALFILM CORPORATION OF SRI LANKA, WHICH HAVE BEEN VESTED IN NATIONAL FILMCORPORATION OF SRI LANKA BY NATIONAL FILM CORPORATION OF SRI LANKA ACT,No. 47 OF 1971 AMENDED BY ACT, No. 45 OF 1980\n\nNOTIFICATION published by the Chairman of National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka by virtue of the powers vested inthe Chairman under Section 57 of National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka Act, No. 47 of 1971 amended by Act, No. 45 of1980\n\nIn relation to the case No. DSP 99/2018 filed by private film distribution circuits against National Film Corporation,the order of suspension, which has been issued by Court suspending the notification made by the Chairman of NationalFilm Corporation of Sri Lanka to film distribution circuits on 19.06.2018 making the agreement/understanding which hasbeen made between Corporation and distribution circuits entrusting film distribution to private circuits, null and void, hasbeen dissolved and further interim injunction requested from the Court against National Film Corporation by privatedistribution circuits has also been rejected."
