    "chunk_size_bytes": 1956,
    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.20193A\n\n2.4.1 Local films\n\nThe document containing the composition of the Evaluation Board is attached herewith.(Annex 02)\n\n2.4.1.2 The aforesaid Evaluation Board will categorise films in the following manner after watchingthe films submitted to the board.\n\n* Films with classical - attractive characteristics* Films with commercial-attractive characteristics* Films with the combination of classical - attractive characteristics and commercial-attractivecharacteristics\n\nThe document containing the criteria prepared by the aforesaid Evaluation Board and applicableto the categorisation of films is attached herewith. (Annex 03)\n\nFilms which are not included in the above categorization will not be scheduled for screening atCinema Halls. A Board of Appeal for the evaluation of local films (Hereinafter referred to as\u201cBoard of Appeal\u201d) has been appointed giving opportunity to producers for making an appeal.\n\nThe document containing the composition of the aforesaid Board of Appeal is attached herewith(Annex 04)\n\n2.4.1.3 Local films, which are categorised by the aforesaid Evaluation Board, should be submitted tothe Public Performance Board by the producer of film.\n\n2.4.1.4 Producer should hand over the films, to which the certificate of Public Performance Board isissued, to the Corporation for scheduling and distribution.\n\n2.4.1.5 The films handed over by the producer (Hereinafter referred to as \u201cFilm Reserve\u201d) will beincluded in the Films Reserve to be screened as per the order of dates in the certificate issuedby Public Performance Board.\n\n2.4.1.6 For the purpose of obtaining recommendations for releasing films to Cinema Halls a SchedulingCommittee for local films will be appointed (Hereinafter referred to as \u201cScheduling Committee\u201d)."
