    "chunk_text": "11. If it is required to release, at a specific occasion, a film with limited number of copies to a certain channel for ashort period, such film can be released in a manner not to cause hindrance to the main release of the respectivechannel on the written approval of the Chairman based on the recommendations of scheduling committee andevaluation board.\n\n13. However, in case where the appointed screening opportunity is not obtained in respect of a particular film withoutabove mentioned reasonable grounds, the film should be included in the last place of the waiting list mentionedunder 10. Further the chance given to not obtain such screening opportunity should be limited to two occasions.\n\n14. A new film will be scheduled in each channel from the film reserve within two weeks from the release of one filmout of the films scheduled under each channel. This order will be applied continually.\n\n15. Action will be taken to screen the trailer of films scheduled under each channel at least with two films screenedpreviously and no payment should be made to a cinema hall or any other party for screening trailers.\n\nAll publicity campaigns related to a film can be carried out on the discretion of the producer of the film. Howeverif it is expected to entrust pre- publicity campaign to the Corporation, action should be taken in the followingmanner. In order to send following items to Cinema Halls, they should be handed over to Corporation in thefollowing manner.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.20196A\n\n15.1 Trailer should be handed over to Corporation two weeks before the first release of the next two releases.\n\n15.2 Photo Cards should be handed over two weeks before the second release.\n\n15.3 Posters and main hoardings should be handed over two weeks before the release of the respective film."
