    "chunk_text": "22. Even though this methodology is implemented with a view to maintain film industry without interruption, thismethodology will be revised from time to time considering the recommendations and observations made inscientific and research aspects by the Investigation and Research Division of the Corporation on practical issuesarisen in Distribution, Marketing, Production, Research and Investigation divisions.\n\n24. The Chairman of the Corporation retains all powers for revision, cancellation and determination of matters includingcirculars/guidelines issued for the purpose of implementation of the film screening and distribution methodology.\n\n25. Any decision taken by the Chairman of the Corporation regarding any matter in relation to the methodology issuedto ensure proper distribution of films should be the final.\n\n26. In case of any inconsistency observed among Sinhala, Tamil and English texts, Sinhala text should prevail.\n\nIn this methodology, unless the context otherwise requires,\n\n\u201cAct\u201d means the National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka Act No 47 of 1971 amended by Act No 45 of 1980.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.20197A\n\n\u201cNational Film Corporation of Sri Lanka\u201d means the National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka establishedunder National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka Act No 47 of 1971 amended by Act No 45 of 1980.\n\n\u201cFilm\u201d means a local or imported film.\n\nException:By virtue of the powers of the National Film Corporation Act No 47 of 1971 amended by Act No 45 of1980, regulations, which are subsequent and relevant to all tasks connecting to the distribution of filmsincluding scheduling films for cinema halls, releasing films for screening and collecting income in therelease of films, will be issued in due course.\n\nANUSHA GOKULA FERN