    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2130/28 - 2019 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 03 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.03\n\nNo. 2130/28 \u2013 WEDNESDAY JULY, 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE PRASHANSANEEYA SEVA VIBHUSHANAYA AND THE PRASHANSANEEYA SEVA PADAKKAMA\n\nIT is hereby notified that HIS EXCELLENCY the PRESIDENT has been pleased to award the Prashansaneeya Seva Vibhushanaya and the Prashansaneeya Seva Padakkama to the Naval Personnel specified in the scheduled here to. By His Excellency's Command, GENERAL S H S KOTTEGODA (Rtd) WWV, RWP, RSP, VSV, USP ndc Secretary, Ministry of Defence. At Colombo.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (1) - GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A G 30441 - 42 (2019/07)\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.07.03 PART I \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.07.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
