    "chunk_text": "02. Lot No. 14904Name of Land: Paranagampitiya Estate; Description: Estate;Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: A part of lot 14887.Required for Central Expressway Project; Extent: 0.2921Hectare.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'04PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.07.20192A\n\nNo. 13425 of P.P. 3016. Encroched by Abegoda GeekiyanageChandanee Algama. Required for Central Expressway Project;Extent: 0.1276 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 14908Name of Land: Paranagampitiya Estate; Description: BarrenLand; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: A part of lotNo. 6826B of P.P. 1296 Required for Central ExpresswayProject; Extent: 0.0823 Hectare.\n\n05. Lot No. 14911Name of Land: Paranagampitiya Estate; Description: BarrenLand; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: A part of lotNo. 6826B of P.P. 1296. Required for Central ExpresswayProject; Extent: 0.0566 Hectare.\n\n06. Lot No. 14912Name of Land: Deduru Oya; Description: Oya; Claimant:Government; Original Claimant: A part of lot No. 14891 Requiredfor Central Expressway Project; Extent: 0.1509 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired by are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Ibbagamuwa Divisional Secretariat, on the day of the 28thAugust, 2019 at 09.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st August,2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for computation for the said land/servitude theamount of compensation and the details of the computationof such amount.\n\nM. A. S. MARASINGHE,\n\nDivisional Secretary,\n\nIbbagamuwa.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Ibbagamuwa.\n\n07 - 641\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
