    "chunk_text": "wxl 2130$41 - 2019 cQ,s ui 04 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'07'04No. 2130/41 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 04 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n1A- PG 4584 - 62 (2019/07)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: DIVIB/LND/LADAQ/CEP/05/2015/12.\n\nMinistry of Land and Parliamentary ReformsReference No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/388.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act as amendment by the LandAcquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following lands which are required for a publicpurpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired :\n\nThe allotments of land, containing in extent of 3.9330Hectares, Lots 148 - 195 (43 lots) under mentioned land shownin the Surveyor General's plan of F.V.P. 1181 Supplement No.08 and Sheet No. 08 dated 31.01.2019 situated in the village ofKoongahagedara in the Grama Niladhari Divisions of No. 524,Nembilikumbara in the Minor Division of Ihala Wisideke Korale\n\nin the Divisional Secretary's Division of Ibbagamuwa in theKurunegala District of North Western Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 148Name of the Land: Galpoththe Hena; Description of Land:Open wasteland; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant:A part of the Lot No. 10 is taken over under Section 38 (A) ofthe Land Acquisition Act. Original Claimant could not befound; To finalize the acquisition process; Extent: 0.4241Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 149Name of the Land: Galpoththe Hena; Description of Land:Open wasteland; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant:A part of the Lot No. 10 is taken over under Section 38 (A) ofthe Land Acquisition Act. Original Claimant H.M.D.B. Herath.To finalize the acquisition process (594 sq.m); Extent: 0.0594Hectare."
